{
  "_comment": [
    "oh-my-opencode-slim — Agent preset and fallback configuration",
    "Copied to /root/.config/opencode/oh-my-opencode-slim.json at container startup",
    "by lib/config.sh. To override: mount your own file to that path.",
    "",
    "Presets define which model, variant, skills, and MCP servers each agent uses.",
    "Set 'preset' to the name of the active preset (e.g. 'default', 'copilot').",
    "",
    "Variants: 'high' (max quality), 'medium' (balanced), 'low' (fast/cheap).",
    "Skills: ['*'] = all skills, [] = none, or list specific skill names.",
    "MCPs: list of MCP server names from opencode.json to make available.",
    "",
    "disabled_mcps switches off MCP servers the plugin injects itself (context7,",
    "gh_grep). Those are separate definitions from the same-named entries in",
    "opencode.json, so setting enabled:false there does not stop the plugin's",
    "remote one — it has to be listed here as well.",
    "",
    "Fallback: give each role's 'model' an array — first entry is the primary,",
    "the rest are tried in order if the primary is unavailable or errors out.",
    "Retry behaviour is controlled by fallback.enabled and fallback.maxRetries."
  ],

  "preset": "default",
  "disabled_mcps": [
    "context7"
  ],
  "presets": {
